{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1111111-1111-4111-8004-000000000004",
    "name": "04 - Mulesoft",
    "description": "BSG workspace — Anypoint **read-first** samples (aligned with `env.sample` / `MuleSoft-TEST-Collection`).\n\n## Auth\nRun **1. Auth → Get access token** first. Script stores `mulesoft_access_token`.\n\n## Variables (environment)\n- `mulesoft_base_url` — US: https://anypoint.mulesoft.com | EU: https://eu1.anypoint.mulesoft.com\n- `mulesoft_api_base_url` — Often `.../amc/application-manager/api/v2` or ARM UI path used in your org\n- `mulesoft_client_id` / `mulesoft_client_secret` — Connected App\n- `mulesoft_organization_id` — required for some list calls\n\n## If List applications returns 404\nSwitch `mulesoft_api_base_url` to match your working `MuleSoft-TEST-Collection.json` (ARM vs AMC).",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{mulesoft_access_token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get access token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const j = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.environment.set('mulesoft_access_token', j.access_token);",
                  "    pm.test('Token received', () => pm.expect(j.access_token).to.be.a('string').and.not.empty);",
                  "} else {",
                  "    pm.test('Auth failed', () => pm.expect.fail(pm.response.text()));",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/x-www-form-urlencoded" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "urlencoded",
              "urlencoded": [
                { "key": "client_id", "value": "{{mulesoft_client_id}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "client_secret", "value": "{{mulesoft_client_secret}}", "type": "text" },
                { "key": "grant_type", "value": "client_credentials", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{mulesoft_base_url}}/accounts/api/v2/oauth2/token"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Health & connectivity",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET accounts/api/me",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{mulesoft_access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{mulesoft_base_url}}/accounts/api/me"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "List environments for organization",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{mulesoft_access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{mulesoft_base_url}}/accounts/api/organizations/{{mulesoft_organization_id}}/environments"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Read-only smoke (Application Manager)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List applications",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{mulesoft_access_token}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{mulesoft_api_base_url}}/applications"
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
